      "title": "能量总量与经验逐场模拟",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "分别利用能量单调下降与经验胜后增长的性质。",
      "steps": [
        "training=max(0,sumEnergy+1-initialEnergy)",
        "experience=initialExperience",
        "逐对手：若 experience<=opponent，补 opponent+1-experience",
        "获胜后 experience+=opponent",
        "返回 training"
